  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#update-the-image-data can end up parsing the URL twice.\r\n\r\n```\r\nvar img = new Image(); img.src = \"not-in-cache\";\r\n```\r\nstep 5.1, then step 11\r\n\r\nAccording to @annevk this breaks blob URLs.\r\n\r\nThen https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#reacting-to-environment-changes will also happily parse the same URL multiple times.",
